    "text": "「想再領教一下童兄的槍法，還望不吝賜教。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=serious);",
    "links": [
      25
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 25,
    "actorID": "NPC15",
    "text": "「可以。不過親兄弟明算帳，指導你練功，我也要耗費心神。收你50錢，不過分吧？」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(NPC15,pic=smile);",
    "links": [
      26
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 26,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "[panel=2]「果然要錢…」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=dislike);",
    "links": [
      27
    ]
  },
  {
